      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CALIFORNIA GRASS (3) has been a fair while since she won a race. Last start finished 1.2 lengths back in third over 2200m at Grafton. She does seem to be wanting this type of journey and look for an improve run. FLAMING GENESIS (6) will be up near the lead much of the way. They have applied the blinkers now and that may bring some improvement. Goes up in journey and is capable of a show. NATURE BOY (5) has won his only time at this track. Steps up in distance today and should be ready now. ZWEIG (1) is stepping out at this course for the first time. Last appeared when he finished ninth over 2200m at Eagle Farm on October 24. Fitter third up and finds a suitable race.",
